<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia to offer A$500 mln in T-bonds.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia to offer A$500 mln in T-bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury will offer a total of A$500 million in Treasury bonds through a tender on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said.  </p>
<p>The offering will comprise A$200 million of 10.0 percent bonds maturing October 2007 and A$300 million of 7.50 percent bonds maturing in September 2009.</p>
<p>The bank said bids would be received until 12.45 pm. (0245 GMT) on Tuesday and results will be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0400 GMT). Settlement date is July 31.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
